WEBVTT

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.280
Big Brother...

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.630
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:40.600
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.100
<i>You are my star</i>

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:47.610
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.350
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:05.460
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:12.770
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:18.310
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:25.440
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:30.920
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:33.350
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:40.300
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.560
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:46.630
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:49.140
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:53.680
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:59.480
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:02.380
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.670
Run!

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:20.200
--Lisa...
--Sachi...

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.430
Right!

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:28.010
Huh?!

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:29.270
Devotion!

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:34.170
Huh?

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:39.490
Let's go, Sachi!

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:41.260
Okay, Lisa!

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.420
Hya!

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:46.830
Hya!

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:47.820
Hup!

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:51.370
Now, Sachi!

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.170
Okay, Lisa!

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:54.160
Hya!

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.240
<i>How can they dodge them so well?</i>

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.640
I know!

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:03.480
<i>The enemy's next move...</i>

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:06.080
<i>They've already seen it!</i>

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.180
<i>They know how the enemy will come.</i>

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:11.820
Yes. Everyone seeks something.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:15.390
Once you know what it is, the path will open by itself.

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:18.330
First, you must feel what the other person wants.

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:20.930
I'll try it!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:34.870
<i>I see it!</i>

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:41.870
--Oh! Wonderful!
--Oh! Wonderful!

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.600
What...

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:08.280
What would you know?

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:11.680
About my feelings... my sadness...

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.250
What would you know about my hatred?!

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:15.780
I know all about it!

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:16.980
What?!

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:26.590
You've only been running from Humans, after all!

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:30.100
All the time that I was suffering in the Human world,

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.700
what were you doing?

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.970
You were only running away!

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.880
So much fun!

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:48.940
Kill him!

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.840
What the-

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:12.830
Huh?!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.480
Y-You're...

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.040
B-Baphomet!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.590
W-Wait!

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.160
Why didn't you finish me off?!

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.340
Worthless.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.080
What?!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.810
Impertinent child.

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:53.210
It's not worth dirtying my hands on you.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:06:00.190
If you keep running away like this, you have no future.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:02.620
Wha-What do you mean...

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:08.260
I'm...

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:11.970
I'm not running...

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.130
I'm not running away!!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.700
Jirtas...

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:23.910
You, child torn between two destinies...

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:29.510
Come to me. Then shall
I grant you your wishes.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:45.500
I'm not running away.
I've only lived as I pleased!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:50.800
But that... That's not what your mother wanted!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:58.440
Poring... Poring!

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:14.790
Over here!

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.510
--Awesome!
--Awesome!

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:27.500
--Yes!
--Yes!

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:29.480
Huh?

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.480
--Are you the Hero?
--Are you the Hero?

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:36.380
No, I... I'm not a Hero.

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:39.420
I'm just a Crusader.

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:42.550
I just want to protect the people I love.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:45.460
Huh?!

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:46.660
You're...

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.330
You've finally seen the light?

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:52.990
Just as I thought...

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.330
You've got promise.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.840
So now...

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:02.210
So now, I shall reveal...

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.880
my...

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.940
My true form.

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:13.290
Lisa, that's the one in the story book...

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:15.760
Right, Sachi.
It just might be...

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.330
--The Witch in the Legend!
--The Witch in the Legend!

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.950
Huh?! The Witch in the Legend?!

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:26.560
It's been a long time since
I've heard that name.

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:55.500
It's a pretty sound, isn't it, Mother?

00:08:55.500 --> 00:09:01.140
Yes, that music box joins
Humans and Monsters together.

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:03.070
You probably know that.

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:07.440
After all, the blood of your father and me runs in you.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:11.410
I was...

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:16.580
I was only running away.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.450
That's right.
And you couldn't stand...

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:23.560
...to see that Alice-<i>chan</i> and I were friends, right?

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.620
That's why...

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:33.970
Poring.

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:37.240
That's right, if you weren't here,

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:39.470
Alice-<i>chan</i> would still be...

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.810
I'll...

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:43.610
Poring... Pori Poring!

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:45.670
Poring! Agh!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:52.980
Poring... Oh! Pori... pori...

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:29.060
Alice-<i>chan</i>!

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:33.360
Huh?

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.830
Forgive? Her?!

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:42.340
But... But Alice-<i>chan,</i> you aren't angry?

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:43.800
You don't hate her?

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:02.690
Why?

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:06.290
I'd like to send you to hell with my own hands!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:07.800
With these hands!

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:08.920
But...

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:14.670
Alice-<i>chan</i> says I shouldn't.
That's why...

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.000
Alice...

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:21.000
But you'd better not run away again.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:28.510
It's all right now, isn't it... Alice-<i>chan</i>?

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:39.350
Poring!

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.530
Zephyrus!

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.400
What do you want?!

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:53.860
I'm in control here!
Don't interfere!

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.450
You're mistaken...

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:01.250
I came for enjoyment.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:02.780
What?!

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:06.250
For the enjoyment of a rare game.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:11.160
To see the future of a soul burned in flames of sadness...

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.020
What do you mean?!

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:20.660
I'm referring to your soul.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:22.730
Huh?!

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:33.850
How did you know I would stay my sword?

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:36.350
I knew by looking at your eyes.

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:37.550
Huh?

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:41.660
They held no intent to kill.

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.950
You were testing me, weren't you?

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:48.830
I was right. You are an interesting boy.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:52.400
I'll give this to you.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:54.000
Huh?

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.700
The sword that had imprisoned me.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.340
Incredible...

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.110
Why are you giving this to me?

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:06.250
I told you, because you seem interesting.

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:08.180
Huh?

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.790
Now, listen well.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:14.590
One who only believes in strength will be swallowed by that sword.

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:16.650
Never forget that.

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:24.230
Now, what were you supposed to protect with your strength?

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:26.430
What I am supposed to protect...

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:35.180
Go.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:36.170
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.170
Good luck!

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.550
Fire...

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.540
...Ball!

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:51.590
What's the big idea?!

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:57.570
I told you. It's a game.

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:59.070
It was all...

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:01.870
a game.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:06.970
Your soul was only a pawn in the game.

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:09.340
My soul?!

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:14.620
My soul is going to be used to break the seal?

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.750
That's right.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:24.260
Your soul will be one of the crystals that breaks the Dark Lord from the seal.

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:26.530
Rejoice!

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.160
The Dark Lord?

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:31.570
Damn you! You tricked me?!

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:37.100
That is not so. You lost the game.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:43.270
When you began to doubt your own heart and fell out of harmony with us.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:49.250
Come! The Dark Lord awaits at Glast Heim!

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:52.220
No!

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:53.350
Maaya!

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:01.460
Poring.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:02.860
Poring! Poring!

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:04.330
Meddler...

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:07.560
Soul...

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:14.410
...Strike!!

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:25.520
Jirtas!

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:37.160
I won't... I won't be killed off so easily!

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.040
That is how it should be.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:45.340
Allow me a little fun, if you please.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:53.210
Lord of...

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:01.950
...Vermilion!

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.970
This is the end.

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:16.030
But the drawback... this is slow to take effect.

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:19.460
Poring!

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.310
Jirtas?

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:28.980
I won't run anymore.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:35.560
But...

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:37.490
It might have been too late...

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:01.940
Poring...

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:20.930
A magnificent soul of jealousy...

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:24.740
Your death makes you useful to me.

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:36.910
Pitiable Jirtas... child of sorrow...

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:41.320
I did as you said.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.660
I never asked you to do anything.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.160
What a grump.

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:51.390
Well, never mind. I was interested in that boy, too.

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:55.160
Still, are you sure about this?

00:17:57.170 --> 00:18:01.110
I won't let the Dark Lord have his way.

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:04.280
Wouldn't it be faster for you to intervene, then?

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:07.280
Do you want to start a hundred years of warfare?

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:10.270
Your human race will be killed off.

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:13.810
That might be interesting, too.

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:23.200
There's no need to cry, little child.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:27.270
I shall send you to the other world, too.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:30.470
Although, I don't know if your soul...

00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:36.270
...is dirtied enough to go to Hell where Jirtas awaits.

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:43.550
Yuufa!

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:49.260
<i>I... I was wrong all this time.</i>

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:52.460
<i>The thing that's necessary</i> <i>to me... is Yuufa!</i>

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:55.260
<i>Yet, I...</i>

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:56.560
Yuufa!

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:15.110
Come, fight it, child! Struggle!

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:18.520
Yummy.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.290
Spell Breaker!

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:22.280
Huh?

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:29.700
Poring.

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:31.790
What is this?

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:36.300
Poring.

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:37.640
Ohh...

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:39.810
It's been a long time.

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:42.210
Where have you been?

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:45.410
I've been worried about you.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:47.400
Takius-<i>kun</i>!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:49.710
Takius?

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:55.590
I never expected you to become a Sage!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:56.990
Takius!

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:59.650
Spell Breaker!

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:03.490
Oh, dear?!

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:06.400
Zephyrus...

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:08.440
The truth you pointed to...

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:11.000
...is not the truth I sought!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:15.170
I realized that!
That is why I became a Sage!

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:23.510
How sad. We were to find the ultimate truth together...

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:29.620
Where is the blindfold that I gave you?

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:32.430
As you can see, I have it.

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:33.960
It now serves me...

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.690
...as a warning!

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:54.850
Takius-<i>kun</i>, this is too small an area in which to play.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.720
Come to Glast Heim.

00:20:57.720 --> 00:21:00.880
Let us enjoy ourselves at our leisure.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:06.990
Takius...

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.260
Forgive my tardiness.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.820
You look so awesome now.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.170
Yuufa!

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:31.240
Yuufa!!

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:39.020
Yuufa...

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:45.800
Yuufa, I've got to talk to you...

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:51.140
Keough!

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:52.300
Big Brother...

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:58.450
--Yuufa!
--Roan...

00:21:58.450 --> 00:21:59.440
Huh?

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:03.310
Good-bye.

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:09.980
Wait!

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:12.930
Yuufa!

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:14.090
Wait...

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:29.310
Yuufa!!

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:44.580
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:53.670
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:58.510
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.510 --> 00:23:03.380
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.150 --> 00:23:12.490
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:22.490
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:34.170
<i>This is W. At last, the final battle!</i>

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.010
<i>The destination is without</i> <i>a doubt Glast Heim!</i>

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:39.680
<i>But appearing before Roan</i> <i>and the others is...</i>

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:42.520
<i>Next time,</i> "Place of Reckoning."

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:45.010
<i>Our hearts are one now!</i>
